  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tissala Cereal Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to (1) reduce members post-harvest losses; (2) increase the Unions capacity to clean; store; and deliver grain to buyers; (3) increase the revenues of the Union and its members; and (4) improve its financial and technical management systems.</narrative>
  </description>
